 rusd); approved status value is \"authorized\" not \"approved\" (legit auths were read as declined). Also transactionId as primary id, declinedReason for the miss reason, optional settle amount, and confirmed Rain auto-enforces a card''s non-empty allowedMccs.","tree":{"sha":"e50caa107aa3f05165ef17e0caeb5150b768097a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheApexWu/rain-check/git/trees/e50caa107aa3f05165ef17e0caeb5150b768097a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheApexWu/rain-check/git/commits/9d13c7e02a52c7ef70f1f63bced3654259d3d5ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71040615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheApexWu","id":71040615,"login":"TheApexWu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMDQwNjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TheApexWu/rain-check/commit/9d13c7e02a52c7ef70f1f63bced3654259d3d5ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTydJodoAKDlkMTNjN2UwMmE1MmM3ZWY3MGYxZjYzYmNlZDM2NTQyNTlkM2Q1ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TheApexWu/rain-check/commit/98563a4afea2ca5388bf6375acde1d1897573e2a","sha":"98563a4afea2ca5388bf6375acde1d1897573e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheApexWu/rain-check/commits/98563a4afea2ca5388bf6375acde1d1897573e2a"}],"sha":"9d13c7e02a52c7ef70f1f63bced3654259d3d5ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheApexWu/rain-check/commits/9d13c7e02a52c7ef70f1f63bced3654259d3d5ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71040615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheApexWu","id":71040615,"login":"TheApexWu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMDQwNjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheApexWu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheApexWu/rain-check/commits/98563a4afea2ca5388bf6375acde1d1897573e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:36:05Z","email":"wua14@nyu.edu","name":"Amadeus Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:36:05Z","email":"wua14@nyu.edu","name":"Amadeus Wu"},"message":"rain demo: three-control test (positive/flip/negative) + issue card with allowedMccs — kill the vacuous flip\n\nScoped card now issued WITH allowedMccs (Rain''s real API binds only amount+expiry+MCC, no merchant\nfield). The demo runs a negative control (out-of-MCC) so the in-policy flip can never ''pass'' without\nthe enforcement check firing — resolves whether the sandbox auto-enforces MCC or is a pass-through\nrecorder. Confirmed against Rain''s OpenAPI in the idea sanity-check.","tr