8,"login":"bcarr-rh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTAzNDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/commits/0bc9c2ceadeb40b3d39cbd4013162e71f4d1a557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:57:11Z","email":"9310348+bcarr-rh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Benjamin Carr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:57:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Repin nginx-126 base and swap libevent ignores for curl (#80)\n\nThe current base (e4df050) ships libevent 2.1.13-1.el9_8, so the libevent\nentries are removed. It still carries curl-minimal/libcurl-minimal\n7.76.1-40.el9_8.5 (CVE-2026-8458, CVE-2026-8927), which failed the v0.0.4\nrelease scan. The fix, 7.76.1-40.el9_8.7, is in the UBI repos but not yet\nin any nginx-126 base. nginx does not link libcurl; its only consumers are\nthe curl CLI, librepo and tpm2-tss, none of which the pod runs. Ignore both\nCVEs with a two-week expiry.","tree":{"sha":"bd561ae4b752d89ff6405db40679f09d8a6c7681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/git/trees/bd561ae4b752d89ff6405db40679f09d8a6c7681"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/git/commits/0bc9c2ceadeb40b3d39cbd4013162e71f4d1a557","verification":{"payload":"tree bd561ae4b752d89ff6405db40679f09d8a6c7681\nparent 8fba821c83ec23a908db71545fb8cbe9c2e65068\nauthor Benjamin Carr <9310348+bcarr-rh@users.noreply.github.com> 1790089031 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790089031 -0600\n\nRepin nginx-126 base and swap libevent ignores for curl (#80)\n\nThe current base (e4df050) ships libevent 2.1.13-1.el9_8, so the libevent\nentries are removed. It still carries curl-minimal/libcurl-minimal\n7.76.1-40.el9_8.5 (CVE-2026-8458, CVE-2026-8927), which failed the v0.0.4\nrelease scan. The fix, 7.76.1-40.el9_8.7, is in the UBI repos but not yet\nin any nginx-126 base. nginx does not link libcurl; its only consumers are\nthe curl CLI, librepo and tpm2-tss, none of which the pod runs. Ignore both\nCVEs with a two-week expiry.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqspdHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAO0gQAC30lQ9upH0FkJGYX7dDWi3Z\nzOQcipCTZEdiaLUfeNtRrUmqhWXC1HSlXfKjWn72JqzQyhVn/IHlxFa/IbGEf7z4\nXwnC+LsCN/XO46idrW0V0DElTj3HOplltRcskjqBafas7m3hEbNWUqCvRUJNWpHe\nvOuzITU9vLbTsc0Ux1/UUzPojeupkNZmILVHCNtRrCTmdNgySKN9YBOlRy/1wVtF\nIAKxZ9HT8VNebNFzskPlhQ8gYodXVibw3p/SUHy81K2ZM3RtegOsbWEjl078oaII\n8LeFullwuPJDsUea16uTF2g+iQH6qiUTdM1l3FVGOUO2up35w94R7wWe/82b2uu8\nQAP2ADCSfamFxRQNIktV7UkKHNXCttLEOXzkMnoiJb2OGD+99SF5m5yr3pBpVZWj\nFT/z3jFoJuoMpZ8+6IYrpuKq8f16TYmFliivqnP+mypS9BgQV37BKP1rkyhVE09q\nxqpYLVMjGXpf2es+mMAQYQW114xzvaqFruQ7Z7EFQfduEO+NGhIZwAJb76sZcV91\n4iaWrCBX+H0q7mHoRV7tN4jLyxhu+m9xaVLp1OBUOguyX0NVLiNQdQHIwou6ctiv\nPS4cXfgEbX1WMWa92T6ArSP++Q7rY7DSYPYwZdDGi5rkBU7Jm+jBS0RUwg/icz9q\n65YJDrCpyFkhi/OttkXX\n=8pid\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T14:57:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow