tps://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcarr-rh","id":9310348,"login":"bcarr-rh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTAzNDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcarr-rh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/commits/15aea8b2cf54dc89f98f646621fd721734a8825c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:03:26Z","email":"9310348+bcarr-rh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Benjamin Carr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:03:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Repin nginx-126 base and accept libevent CVEs until Red Hat rebuilds it (#74)\n\nThe pinned base (a612653) carried fixable HIGH CVEs in openssl, rsync and\nlibevent, failing the image scan on every PR and the weekly rebuild. The\ncurrent base (cca859e) fixes openssl and rsync.\n\nlibevent 2.1.13-1.el9_8 is in the UBI repos but not yet in any nginx-126\nbase. nginx does not link libevent; only openldap does, and nginx does not\nload it. Ignore the six CVEs with a two-week expiry.","tree":{"sha":"663623a278771455380b67effb7fb60c822959f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/git/trees/663623a278771455380b67effb7fb60c822959f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/auto-shift/autoshift-console-plugin/git/commits/15aea8b2cf54dc89f98f646621fd721734a8825c","verification":{"payload":"tree 663623a278771455380b67effb7fb60c822959f2\nparent 01365af73be74c006bd64fb102f1283ec