ps://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/cd1617ec764cde2cc75d14351e8b5b40be3958d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T01:04:36Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T01:04:36Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"fix(home): grafico ocupa a altura do card e corrige a cor por direcao\n\nAltura: o card e `flex-1` na coluna da home, mas os graficos tinham\nheight={260} fixo, deixando uma faixa branca embaixo. O card vira coluna\nflex e a area do grafico recebe `flex-1 min-h-0` (sem o min-h-0 um filho\nflex nao encolhe abaixo do conteudo e o height=\"100%\" do\nResponsiveContainer fica sem referencia). O minHeight preserva o piso de\n260px em telas baixas.\n\nCor: groupTotalsByType fixava a direcao pela PRIMEIRA transacao do tipo,\npremissa que quebrou quando o deposito ganhou destino -- \"Deposito\" passou\na ter lancamentos positivos (propria conta) e negativos (outra conta). Com\na lista ordenada por data, um unico deposito negativo recente pintava o\ngrupo inteiro como saida. Agora soma com sinal: a barra mostra o modulo do\nliquido e a cor sai do sinal desse liquido, entao a cor sempre corresponde\nao numero exibido.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"028dcfedf29fe15c4a101e8ed5a3078dcdc573d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/028dcfedf29fe15c4a101e8ed5a3078dcdc573d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/cd1617ec764cde2cc75d14351e8b5b40be3958d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/cd1617ec764cde2cc75d14351e8b5b40be3958d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTyrZi9oAKGNkMTYxN2VjNzY0Y2RlMmNjNzVkMTQzNTFlOGI1YjQwYmUzOTU4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b","sha":"9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b"}],"sha":"cd1617ec764cde2cc75d14351e8b5b40be3958d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/cd1617ec764cde2cc75d14351e8b5b40be3958d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T01:04:24Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T01:04:24Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"fix(auth): token expirado passa a cair na tela de login\n\nO AuthGuard so verificava se EXISTIA um objeto de sessao, nunca se o JWT\nainda valia. Com token vencido, clicar em \"Ja tenho conta\" levava direto\npara a area logada, onde toda chamada respondia 401 e a tela ficava presa\nem \"Nao foi possivel carregar sua conta\", sem pista da causa.\n\n- hasValidSession() le o `exp` do JWT (sem validar assinatura -- quem\n  valida e o backend; aqui e so para nao entrar numa tela que vai falhar)\n- token sem `exp` e tratado como valido de proposito: derrubar o usuario\n  por um formato que nao sabemos ler seria pior que deixar dar 401\n- a sessao invalida e limpa antes do redirect, senao o proximo clique em\n  \"Ja tenho conta\" cairia no mesmo estado\n- interceptor de resposta 401 cobre o token que vence com o usuario ja\n  navegando, caso em que o guard nao roda de novo\n\nRemove tambem console.log de debug que imprimia a sessao inteira (token\nincluido) no console do navegador.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d533a756eab001ca249415799699bf145610f837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/d533a756eab001ca249415799699bf145610f837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b","node_id":"C_kwDOTyrZi9oAKDljNDJkMzYyMzUyNWUyMGEzMjBhNjg2OTc3M2MzNWE0ODcyZjZhM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/7dbb8e6c1e64e253add5170c7a257140e26eb446","sha":"7dbb8e6c1e64e253add5170c7a257140e26eb446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/7dbb8e6c1e64e253add5170c7a257140e26eb446"}],"sha":"9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/9c42d3623525e20a320a6869773c35a4872f6a3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/7dbb8e6c1e64e253add5170c7a257140e26eb446/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:14:17Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:14:17Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"chore(deps): atualiza o design system para 1.24.0\n\nTraz as props `agency`/`account` do bb-balance-card, usadas pelo card de\nboas-vindas da home. O bump do lockfile e necessario: o package.json ja\naceitava ^1.23.1, mas o Dockerfile roda `npm ci`, que instala exatamente o\nque esta no lock -- sem isso a imagem continuaria na 1.23.1 e as props\nseriam ignoradas silenciosamente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5862a096597c7da7e538931a9229346e8386782d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/5862a096597c7da7e538931a9229346e8386782d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/7dbb8e6c1e64e253add5170c7a257140e26eb446","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{