ed_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/717e65323a93fc9fe3a6dbc054e66b16561bc4eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:03:30Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:03:30Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"fix(transacoes): encaminha o destino do deposito para a API\n\nAcompanha a correcao no backend. O bb-new-transaction-list ja emite o valor\ncom sinal (negativo quando o deposito e \"Em outra conta\"), mas os dois MFEs\nfaziam Math.abs() antes de enviar -- e como a API exige valor positivo e\ndecide o sinal pelo tipo, um deposito em outra conta acabava somando ao\nsaldo em vez de subtrair.\n\nAgora o destino vai explicito no payload, derivado do sinal que o DS\ncalcula. Sem depender de nova versao do Design System.\n\nTambem passa agencia e conta ao bb-balance-card, para o card de boas-vindas\nexibi-las sob \"Conta Corrente\" (requer o DS >= a versao com essas props;\nenquanto nao publicada, as props sao ignoradas e o card fica como esta).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42578707380e650239805d96ff42b7d1cafb3442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/42578707380e650239805d96ff42b7d1cafb3442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/717e65323a93fc9fe3a6dbc054e66b16561bc4eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privac