ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/0a03693e71090ff461f494dae8bc89d512d1935a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:53:02Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:53:02Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"docs(deploy): corrige lacuna do git pull e adiciona verificacao\n\nO runbook mandava dar `git pull` so neste repo, mas o docker-compose daqui\nbuilda o backend de ../back-end-grupo1-app-finance. Seguir ao pe da letra\nsubia frontend novo contra backend antigo -- sem erro visivel, so\ncomportamento velho. Foi exatamente o que aconteceu no deploy de hoje.\n\nTambem documenta o que custou tempo na pratica:\n- up -d --build sem down -v mantem o stack servindo durante o build\n- nohup para sessao SSM/SSH instavel nao matar um build de ~10 min\n- scripts de manutencao rodam pelo servico `seed` (que tem /seed montado),\n  nunca por stdin no container mongo, onde o mongosh vira REPL\n- Last-Modified de / nao indica sucesso do deploy: e o index.html do shell,\n  numa layer separada que vem do cache quando o shell nao muda\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9040a465fc801a53ae3530094a6a9b3af870e265","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/9040a465fc801a53ae3530094a6a9b3af870e265"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/0a03693e71090ff461f494dae8bc89d512d1935a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/0a03693e71090ff461f494dae8bc89d512d1935a","node_id":"C_kwDOTyrZi9oAKDBhMDM2OTNlNzEwOTBmZjQ2MWY0OTRkYWU4YmM4OWQ1MTJkMTkzNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b","sha":"756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b"}],"sha":"0a03693e71090ff461f494dae8bc89d512d1935a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/0a03693e71090ff461f494dae8bc89d512d1935a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:16:52Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:16:52Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"feat(home): grafico passa a mostrar os 3 tipos de transacao\n\nVolta a agrupar por tipo (Deposito, Saque e Transferencia Pix) em vez de\npor categoria, agora incluindo Deposito -- que antes ficava de fora por\nser credito.\n\nComo Deposito anda na direcao oposta dos outros dois, o grafico deixou de\nser de \"gastos\": somar entrada e saida num mesmo percentual de gastos nao\nsignificaria nada. Passa a mostrar o VOLUME movimentado por tipo, e a cor\ncodifica a direcao (entrada x saida) para a diferenca ficar explicita em\nvez de escondida. Legenda propria, ja que a cor nao codifica serie.\n\nMantida a barra horizontal ordenada em vez de pizza: com credito e debito\nlado a lado, uma pizza sugeriria parte-de-um-todo que nao existe -- nao\nfaz sentido dizer que o deposito e \"x% do total\" quando ele anda no\nsentido contrario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41ccdc64918d438361a5ab172e8361d6ffab8709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/41ccdc64918d438361a5ab172e8361d6ffab8709"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b","node_id":"C_kwDOTyrZi9oAKDc1NmMzNTBhMDEwMzE3ZmNiNDFiMjQ2OWE2YWJjMGVhNGFjYjZlM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel/bytebank/commit/97ad6609dc917fa2badf71a53f0b1ef22fc06955","sha":"97ad6609dc917fa2badf71a53f0b1ef22fc06955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/97ad6609dc917fa2badf71a53f0b1ef22fc06955"}],"sha":"756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/756c350a010317fcb41b2469a6abc0ea4acb6e3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54954597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/97ad6609dc917fa2badf71a53f0b1ef22fc06955/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:07:52Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T19:07:52Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"feat(home): troca \"gastos por tipo\" por \"gastos por categoria\"\n\nCom a taxonomia consolidada sobraram so dois tipos de saida (Saque e\nTransferencia Pix), entao a pizza por tipo virou um grafico de duas\nfatias -- pouca informacao sobre para onde o dinheiro foi. A categoria e\no eixo que o usuario escolhe no cadastro e tem ~11 valores.\n\nTambem troca a forma, nao so o campo: pizza com muitas classes fica\nilegivel e exigiria uma paleta categorica grande, onde tons vizinhos sao\nindistinguiveis para quem tem daltonismo. Barra horizontal ordenada da\nmaior para a menor resolve os dois problemas -- como o tamanho ja carrega\na comparacao, basta uma cor (o ambar destaca so a maior categoria) e o\nnome fica escrito ao lado de cada barra, sem depender de legenda.\n\nTransacoes sem categoria (o campo e opcional e foi adicionado depois)\ncaem em \"Sem categoria\" em vez de sumirem do total, para os percentuais\nnao mentirem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a47e9dcfe662660b39760aa1ae0ff559757d863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/2a47e9dcfe662660b39760aa1ae0ff559757d863"},"url":"https://api.github.com