r}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/bbb18892c368be5f6c15b502b3a299d6b1d2e534/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:16:31Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:16:31Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"fix(transacoes): alinha os rotulos de tipo com o cadastro\n\nAcompanha a consolidacao de ''transferencia'' em ''pix'' no backend.\n\nO rotulo nao fazia round-trip: o usuario cadastrava \"Transferencia Pix\",\ngravava-se ''pix'' e o extrato/graficos exibiam \"Pix\" -- um nome que nao\nexiste na tela de cadastro. E o filtro de tipo do extrato oferecia\n\"Transferencia\", um tipo que ninguem consegue lancar.\n\n- TYPE_DISPLAY (core e dashboard): ''pix'' -> \"Transferencia Pix\"; remove\n  a entrada ''transferencia''\n- TYPE_API: remove o rotulo \"Transferencia\"; mantem \"Pix\" como alias\n- ApiTransactionType: ''saque'' | ''deposito'' | ''pix''\n- extrato (Angular): typeOptions passa a espelhar as 3 opcoes do cadastro\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b31cf70c79045c1fce33b4dcf2fa3d8b3965a611","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/b31cf70c79045c1fce33b4dcf2fa3d8b3965a611"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/co