ithub.com/users/xLeonel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xLeonel","id":54954597,"login":"xLeonel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTU0NTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xLeonel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/commits/e0812991032ccba7a31cb72da530a6e924ab42bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:57:03Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:57:03Z","email":"vitorleonel100@hotmail.com","name":"Vitor"},"message":"fix(transacoes): ordena lista por data decrescente no front\n\nRede de seguranca para a UI nao depender da ordem devolvida pela API (a\ncausa raiz foi corrigida no backend, que nao tinha .sort() no findByUser).\n\n- listTransactions (@bytebank/core) e systemAccount (dashboard) ordenam a\n  transacao crua, onde `date` ainda e ISO com hora; depois do mapTransaction\n  a data vira DD/MM/YYYY e a hora se perde.\n- TransactionsProvider passa a expor a lista sempre ordenada, cobrindo o\n  caso de uma transacao retroativa aparecer no topo por causa do prepend\n  otimista do addTransaction.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cd7ef5b1501a347de4e6d045d45a5eb5530daee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/trees/3cd7ef5b1501a347de4e6d045d45a5eb5530daee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xLeonel/bytebank/git/commits/e0812991032ccba7a31cb72da530a6e924ab42bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":