c910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"export_transplant: 프론트 소스 복사 모드 + 자기완결성 감사\n\n사용자가 프론트를 소스 복사 방식으로 정했다. --frontend src(기본)/remote/none. src/ 에서 dev,mock 을 빼고 복사하고 빌드된 wp-board.css 와 MERGE.md 를 함께 낸다. 핵심은 Tailwind 설정을 병합하지 않는 것 - prefix/preflight 는 빌드 단위 설정이라 호스트가 이미 Tailwind 를 쓰면 prefix wp- 를 넣는 순간 호스트 유틸리티가 전부 무효가 된다. 대신 빌드된 CSS 한 장을 import 하고 호스트 content 에서 우리 폴더를 제외한다. 감사 추가: dev/mock 부재, 상대 import 자기완결성(가장 강한 검사 - 참조 모양과 무관하게 잡는다), import.meta.env/vue-router/antd 리셋 부재, CSS 선택자 네임스페이스. JS 주석을 걷어낸 뒤 본다 - 주석에만 있던 8건이 오탐으로 잡혔었다. NEGATIVE CONTROL 로 3종 동시 검출 확인.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16130520c1c8ba3c5453765003a15d52820c6a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/16130520c1c8ba3c5453765003a15d52820c6a61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/c971a38b6c5ec496ad55456f2a4aa1881d64fc65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/c971a38b6c5ec496ad55456f2a4aa1881d64fc65","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKGM5NzFhMzhiNmM1ZWM0OTZhZDU1NDU2ZjJhNGFhMTg4MWQ2NGZjNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274","sha":"0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274"}],"sha":"c971a38b6c5ec496ad55456f2a4aa1881d64fc65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/c971a38b6c5ec496ad55456f2a4aa1881d64fc65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:52:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:52:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"tools/export_transplant.py - 이식 번들 생성 + 계약 감사\n\nTRANSPLANT.md 1/3.2 목록을 손으로 옮기는 대신 한 번에 만든다. 요점은 복사가 아니라 복사 후 감사다 - 수동 이관의 실제 사고는 파일을 빠뜨리는 것이 아니라 지워야 할 것을 남기는 것이다(standalone.py가 따라가면 호스트 앱과 FastAPI() 충돌). 개발 전용 파일은 copytree ignore로 애초에 복사하지 않는다. 감사 6종, 하나라도 걸리면 exit 1. AST로 보고 SQL은 주석을 걷어낸 뒤 본다 - 첫 실행에서 주석 오탐 2건이 났다. NEGATIVE CONTROL로 실패 가능성 확인함.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7ffea419f93add0143d076af267920c11abb335","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/c7ffea419f93add0143d076af267920c11abb335"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKDBiNjBhZTEyYWUzOTA0NDlkOTg4MTE3YTA2NWNlODY3ZWNlMzQyNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074","sha":"718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074"}],"sha":"0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/0b60ae12ae390449d988117a065ce867ece34274"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:31:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:31:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"설비사 표시명이 `설비사 #1` 로 나오던 버그 수정\n\n증상: 프로젝트 페이지의 대시보드·Work Package 타이틀이 설비사 이름 대신\n`설비사 #1` 을 표시. wp_dev_makers.name 이 나와야 한다.\n\n원인 셋이 겹쳤다.\n\n① 컨텍스트가 스냅샷이었다. BoardShell 이 provide() 시점의 props.makerName /\n   makerId 를 평범한 값으로 담아, 이후 prop 변경이 반영되지 않았다. 같은 파일이\n   스토어에는 \"호스트가 마운트된 보드에서 바꿀 수 있으니 getter 로\" 라고 써 놓고\n   컨텍스트는 반대로 하고 있었다. → getter 로 변경.\n\n② 서버가 이미 주는 이름을 쓰지 않았다. ProjectOut.maker_name 은 호스트의\n   MakerResolver 를 거친 값인데(개발에서는 wp_dev_makers.name) 폴백에 없어서\n   곧장 원시 id 로 떨어졌다. → 3단 폴백: prop → project.maker_name → 설비사 #{id}.\n   대시보드와 툴바가 같은 규칙을 쓴다.\n\n③ 목이 서버와 어긋나 있었다. 실서버는 모든 ProjectOut 에 maker_name 을 채우는데\n   목은 projectsOverview() 에서만 만들었다 → withMakerName() 로 모든 프로젝트\n   응답에 적용.\n\n검사는 prop 없이 마운트해 G정밀(SEED_MAKERS 의 maker 7)이 나오는지 본다 —\nprop 으로 넘긴 이름을 기대하면 어느 경로로 왔는지 구분하지 못한다.\n실서버로도 확인: 세 프로젝트 모두 maker_name = \"설비사 A (개발 스텁)\".\n\n검증: check:dom 439 passed · verify 558 passed · type-check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8436241873a65339db19a721e919385df605049f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/8436241873a65339db19a721e919385df605049f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKDcxOGFjYjQ3YjQ5NjJlNGJjODE4YTMzMjBmZmQ5N2NhNjcyZjUwNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a","sha":"386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a"}],"sha":"718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/718acb47b4962e4bc818a3320ffd97ca672f5074"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:19:38Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:19:38Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"한쪽 변 테두리가 상자로 그려지던 버그 수정 (preflight off 두 번째 방향)\n\n증상: 설비사 A 의 두 번째·세 번째 프로젝트만 카드로 감싸져 보임 (전체 현황 ·\nIntegrated AI 설비사 관리 양쪽).\n\n원인: `wp-border-t wp-border-solid` 는 구분선이 아니라 테두리 상자를 그린다.\n`border-style: solid` 는 네 변 전부에 걸리는데 두께는 위쪽만 지정되고, preflight 가\n꺼져 있어 나머지 세 변이 0 이 아니라 초기값 medium(약 3px) 이 된다. 실측:\nright/bottom/left = medium/solid. 첫 행만 멀쩡했던 것은 `index > 0` 에만 구분선을\n줘서 `wp-border-*` 가 아예 없었기 때문이다.\n\n수정: `wp-border-0` 동반 — `wp-border-0 wp-border-t wp-border-solid`.\n7개 파일 12곳 (뷰 2 · 모달 3 · 셀 에디터 2).\n\n재발 방지: 기존 auditBorders 는 이 경우를 통과시킨다(스타일이 있으므로). 방향 ②\n감사(borderBoxOffenders)를 추가하고, 섹션 H 에 계산 스타일 프로브와 NEGATIVE\nCONTROL 을 넣었다. styles/tailwind.css 주석이 두 방향의 정본이다.\n\n검증: check:dom 434 passed · verify 558 passed · type-check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6aa2dcc9680583c30f20b217a100456dee9ed850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/6aa2dcc9680583c30f20b217a100456dee9ed850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKDM4NmViOGI5YWI3MzY0YWQ3ZDMyNjJlMTc0MDE0MzViMDRhZDdiMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30","sha":"2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30"}],"sha":"386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/386eb8b9ab7364ad7d3262e17401435b04ad7b2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:10:28Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:10:28Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"접속 정보 backend/.env 분리 · 설비사 관리 화면 카드 개편 · 하니스 메뉴 정리\n\n접속 정보\n- backend/.env.example 커밋(키만), backend/.env 는 gitignore. 저장소 전체에서\n  접속 정보 파일은 이 하나이며 db/*.py 도 이것을 읽는다.\n- 로딩은 개발 전용 진입점에만: app/standalone.py(이식 시 삭제) · tests/ · db/*.py.\n  core/config.py 에는 env_file 을 걸지 않는다 — 이식된 라이브러리가 호스트\n  디렉터리에서 .env 를 찾게 되므로 (INTEGRATION.md §4).\n- python-dotenv 는 requirements-dev.txt 에만. 없으면 조용히 건너뛴다.\n\n설비사 관리 화면 (plan.md §0.6.1-4)\n- antd Table 한 장 → 전체 현황과 같은 카드: 접기/펼치기(기본 펼침),\n  하위 프로젝트 들여쓰기, 옅은 배경 위 흰 카드.\n- 설비사의 전체현황 표시도 체크박스 → 스위치. 한 화면에 두 종류의 on/off 를\n  두지 않는다.\n\n개발 하니스\n- 프로젝트 메뉴 항목 제거 — 진입은 전체 현황 [이동] 뿐이라 \"고른 프로젝트가 없는\n  프로젝트 화면\" 으로 가는 버튼이었다.\n- 하드코딩 설비사 표 제거. 열린 프로젝트에서 maker_id·maker_name 을 거꾸로\n  해석한다 — 이름 해석은 호스트 책임이라는 계약 그대로.\n\n검증: 백엔드 561 passed · verify 558 · check:dom 426 · type-check clean.\nUI 렌더링은 눈으로 확인하지 않았다 (jsdom 은 레이아웃을 계산하지 않는다).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5304c1176fdd4d4a28f28751ac3fefa1ce2535a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/f5304c1176fdd4d4a28f28751ac3fefa1ce2535a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKDJkYjgzNTgzOTdiNzhhOWE3MGNiY2YzMDA4MjEyODg3ODk3NmNjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68","sha":"78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68"}],"sha":"2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/2db8358397b78a9a70cbcf30082128878976cc30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T23:24:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T23:24:24Z","email":"khc910821@gmail.com","name":"hckim821"},"message":"DSEP Work Package 보드 초기 커밋\n\ndocs/Work Package.xlsx 의 Project Board(35행)를 대체하는 웹 시스템.\nVue3 + TypeScript + Tailwind + antd + ag-grid Community / FastAPI / MariaDB.\n\n이 저장소는 독립 실행형 제품이 아니다 — 프론트엔드는 Module Federation\nremote 로, 백엔드는 가동 중인 FastAPI 프로젝트에 이식된다. 계약은\nINTEGRATION.md, 절차는 TRANSPLANT.md.\n\n접속 정보는 저장소에 두지 않는다. WP_DB_PASSWORD / WP_DB_DSN 환경변수로\n받으며, 미설정 시 백엔드는 기동을 거부하고 DB 테스트는 이유를 밝히며\nskip 된다 (README §1.1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5234a981b5f1184b4f4ebdca01af949e855f896d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/trees/5234a981b5f1184b4f4ebdca01af949e855f896d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/git/commits/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94617399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821","id":94617399,"login":"hckim821","node_id":"U_kgDOBaO_Nw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hckim821","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hckim821/wp-board/commit/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68","node_id":"C_kwDOTys7PdoAKDc4NTU3ZmZjZDljZmFkMjBmNmJkZjFiMTIwNTFkNTJhYTQ0Y2ZmNjg","parents":[],"sha":"78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/commits/78557ffcd9cfad20f6bdf1b12051d52aa44cff68"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/hckim821/wp-board/comm