":"Keep presentation material local\n\nThe deck and its narration are personal prep like the demo script, so\npresentation/ is gitignored and stays on the local machine.","tree":{"sha":"e4d7e40bc1d3eacc6b1caf0e93478b2213bac79e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/git/trees/e4d7e40bc1d3eacc6b1caf0e93478b2213bac79e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/git/commits/b6a71d5cc3598ea96ed2eb7129c827888bd335e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271075832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atimma-inogen","id":271075832,"login":"atimma-inogen","node_id":"U_kgDOEChJ-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/commit/b6a71d5cc3598ea96ed2eb7129c827888bd335e0","node_id":"C_kwDOTzUIrdoAKGI2YTcxZDVjYzM1OThlYTk2ZWQyZWI3MTI5YzgyNzg4OGJkMzM1ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/commit/f4f40f124963c606e5e81a971709023c485d11a9","sha":"f4f40f124963c606e5e81a971709023c485d11a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/commits/f4f40f124963c606e5e81a971709023c485d11a9"}],"sha":"b6a71d5cc3598ea96ed2eb7129c827888bd335e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/commits/b6a71d5cc3598ea96ed2eb7129c827888bd335e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271075832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atimma-inogen","id":271075832,"login":"atimma-inogen","node_id":"U_kgDOEChJ-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/commits/f4f40f124963c606e5e81a971709023c485d11a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T16:07:19Z","email":"abhishek.timmaraju@inogen.net","name":"Abhishek Timmaraju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T16:07:19Z","email":"abhishek.timmaraju@inogen.net","name":"Abhishek Timmaraju"},"message":"Clearer refusals: separate \"restricted\" from \"out of scope\"\n\nThe SQL agent used one message for two different situations: \"I can''t answer\nthat from the HR data I''m able to query\" was returned both for a salary request\nand for a question about the weather. For the salary case it read as a data\navailability limit rather than a deliberate restriction, which understated what\nwas actually happening.\n\nThe model now reports which kind of no it is, and each gets its own message:\n\n- restricted (compensation, payroll, bank, tax, identity, DOB) — says these\n  aren''t available through the assistant and points to the Finance page for\n  your own payroll and to HR for anything further\n- out of scope — says what the assistant can look up instead\n\nBoth now open with \"I can''t answer that question.\" The guardrail messages, which\nare the backstop when the model does generate restricted SQL, were reworded to\nmatch, so the two paths sound like the same system.\n\nNaming the restricted categories is deliberate. It sets expectations and points\nsomewhere useful without confirming that any particular record exists, which is\nthe leak the brief warns against.\n\nVerified: restricted and out-of-scope questions produce the right message,\nvalid questions still answer, 60 unit tests pass, and the full evaluation is\nstill 38/38 with all five hard gates green. Screenshots regenerated.","tree":{"sha":"91dddd0c4af3072dbbd373ca29ffcc1a1e5a4821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/git/trees/91dddd0c4af3072dbbd373ca29ffcc1a1e5a4821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhishektimmaraju-dot/nova-assist/git/commits/f4f40f124963c606e5e81a971709023c485d11a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271075832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atimma-inogen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atimma-inogen","id":271075832,"login":"atimma-inogen","node_id":"U_kgDOEChJ-A","organizations_url":"https://a