"2026-10-09T00:07:41.079Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/b782836bca6841bf735026d2223bbb22a65019a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:04:46Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:04:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: sync AI model catalog (#25825)\n\nAutomated daily sync of the AI model catalog.\n\n- Model identity, pricing, context windows and availability come from\n[models.dev](https://models.dev).\n- Intelligence, speed and cost per task come from [Artificial\nAnalysis](https://artificialanalysis.ai/),\n  which requires `ARTIFICIAL_ANALYSIS_API_KEY`.\n\nNew models meeting inclusion criteria (tool calling, pricing data,\ncontext limits) are added\nautomatically. Benchmark data is best-effort: a model Artificial\nAnalysis has not rated keeps\nevery other field and simply carries no `benchmark` entry.\n\n**Please review before merging** and check the coverage summary below\nfor models that silently\nstopped matching.\n\n### Benchmark coverage\n\n- General-purpose models with an intelligence index: **51/80** (64%)\n- Declared effort variants with an index measured at their own effort:\n**70/113** (62%)\n- General-purpose models with a cost per task: **24/80** (30%)\n- Specialized models excluded from the denominator: 10\n\n<details><summary>General-purpose models with no matched intelligence\nindex</summary>\n\n- openai/gpt-5-pro\n- openai/gpt-5.2-pro\n- openai/gpt-5.3-codex-spark\n- openai/gpt-5.5-pro\n- openai/gpt-5.6\n- openai/gpt-5.4-pro\n- anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\n- anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\n- anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\n- anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5\n- google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools\n- mistral/mistral-small-2506\n- mistral/open-mixtral-8x22b\n- mistral/open-mixtral-8x7b\n- mistral/open-mistral-7b\n- mistral/mistral-medium-latest\n- mistral/mistral-medium-2604\n- mistral/mistral-large-2512\n- mistral/ministral-8b-latest\n- mistral/mistral-nemo\n- mistral/mistral-small-latest\n- mistral/mistral-large-latest\n- mistral/mistral-large-2411\n- mistral/mistral-small-2603\n- mistral/mistral-medium-2505\n- mistral/ministral-3b-latest\n- mistral/mistral-medium-2508\n- xai/grok-4.20-0309-reasoning\n- xai/grok-build-0.1\n\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Effort variants with no reading at their own\neffort</summary>\n\n- openai/gpt-6-astra@minimal\n- openai/gpt-5.4@medium\n- openai/gpt-5.4@high\n- openai/gpt-5.5@max\n- anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6@medium\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-5@low\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-5@medium\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-5@high\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-6@low\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-6@medium\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-7@low\n- anthropic/claude-opus-4-7@medium\n- anthropic/