web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/b782836bca6841bf735026d2223bbb22a65019a6","node_id":"C_kwDOTzfBtdoAKGI3ODI4MzZiY2E2ODQxYmY3MzUwMjZkMjIyM2JiYjIyYTY1MDE5YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/2badd5da7db126e9b8e41c90bfa9617486205866","sha":"2badd5da7db126e9b8e41c90bfa9617486205866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/2badd5da7db126e9b8e41c90bfa9617486205866"}],"sha":"b782836bca6841bf735026d2223bbb22a65019a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/b782836bca6841bf735026d2223bbb22a65019a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142569587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ehconitin","id":142569587,"login":"ehconitin","node_id":"U_kgDOCH9wcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/2badd5da7db126e9b8e41c90bfa9617486205866/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T19:40:21Z","email":"142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nitin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T19:40:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Granola 7/8: Filter Granola synchronization by folder (#25576)\n\nScopes live sync and history imports to selected Granola folders.\n\n- Folder picker in the settings, modelled on the email folder settings:\nan \"Everything\" / \"Some folders\" policy card, then a searchable folder\ntree with a toggle-all header and per-folder checkboxes that save on\nclick (up to 100). A picked folder covers its subfolders, which show as\nchecked; the only picked folder cannot be unchecked, switch to\n\"Everything\" instead. This is a first iteration of the picker UI; the\nfinal design will come later.\n- Selection is applied to the Granola endpoint''s `folder_ids` and to\ndiscovery (one discovery job per selected parent). Granola filters\ndeliveries and discovery by folder, so no per-note folder check is\nneeded.\n- A pending selection is kept only while a save can still be retried;\npermanent Granola errors clear it and surface inline. The daily catch-up\nand re-registration apply a pending selection.\n- Concurrent folder saves from two admins are not serialized; app KV has\nno compare-and-set.\n\nStack 7/8. Merge in order and retain base branches until dependent PRs\nare retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","tree":{"sha":"4a3e47f80c86581d7b390f4ba0d457cdf9e2d67c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/4a3e47f80c86581d7b390f4ba0d457cdf9e2d67c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/2badd5da7db126e9b8e41c90bfa9617486205866","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a3e47f80c86581d7b390f4ba0d457cdf9e2d67c\nparent 66e94cbfc7b70f521ff2a2246e6fe63df7c709f7\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789155621 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789155621 +0000\n\nGranola 7/8: Filter Granola synchronization by folder (#25576)\n\nScopes live sync and history imports to selected Granola folders.\n\n- Folder picker in the settings, modelled on the email folder settings:\nan \"Everything\" / \"Some folders\" policy card, then a searchable folder\ntree with a toggle-all header and per-folder checkboxes that save on\nclick (up to 100). A picked folder covers its subfolders, which show as\nchecked; the only picked folder cannot be unchecked, switch to\n\"Everything\" instead. This is a first iteration of the picker UI; the\nfinal design will come later.\n- Selection is applied to the Granola endpoint''s `folder_ids` and to\ndiscovery (one discovery job per selected parent). Granola filters\ndeliveries and discovery by folder, so no per-note folder check is\nneeded.\n- A pending selection is kept only while a save can still be retried;\npermanent Granola errors clear it and surface inline. The daily catch-up\nand re-registration apply a pending selection.\n- Concurrent folder saves from two admins are not serialized; app KV has\nno compare-and-set.\n\nStack 7/8. Merge in order and retain base branches until dependent PRs\nare retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpFk1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiAwQAH4Vm3vEbHG6olbDYlblPUr/\nDgsv4hgyVVvg/kf6MOoGq4N3Z1JXPLVzuQCsFomCa4hyxqH+GhzxkiqoNVtarauh\ndWwl7hTWY0GQSIxxy4rnLCkg1vmd7yJ1X8XhUgdwRMTUzIKUzwTjCaR/XgoNW5iQ\nFbb8Y/243jJThBrbnSssauC1IvxOjdyqv9HMut96ZTfsukRSMUInIBLC3OH9kMbs\noV3mNsRGxaulOjF3VJyrjA/jqBeTzraRkk2EbmNfohU2q4shnqqLgd7US/WlK6aH\nT9oKKu981rwjAV2m71yB0o7HJD/q0r5kIW+HiTA4kxNQjfTCG2KyplZI8EyOtfh+\nDCLhBrHUIWhs1JGj25TKfNLvFvf1UbGaVJXbL/Mww2D3Xmu27qw4KoRQR8gJMl3A\nEk+q28DcIHVFV0IMlb+7zf8nIVvrYh/MhT952TsYEercAcHi5fqPjwYWoLbfCrLG\nU1pNtCYIf18pcQMqoImG5IfpmJPSiUCWp05t4+Yxex9/sHoyPr4DK0ezONPK4kMX\niwK4ukY6eJDaJ/I1R/VmvIbIkROXo5eksgvtz5dYW225Ii8YuquGWD/iDllwMqKj\ndqgAh+Dt9slIyizgN7kPsv+gpWTTIUlyWtfltoj+92TqnCLkbZlw5IdUx6empqTk\ndlOGm5e988/Y07slxYlU\n=1Q3I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T09:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_ur