 rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"5003808cb4be6778f93c8ea0ccaad8bd60ffc405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/5003808cb4be6778f93c8ea0ccaad8bd60ffc405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/00598ef1ed537b4dec6214f2f68f6f5fdd430b6e","verification":{"payload":"tree 5003808cb4be6778f93c8ea0ccaad8bd60ffc405\nparent 96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789133262 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789133262 +0000\n\nComplete call recordings whose Recall transcript is empty (#25793)\n\nRecall can finish a transcript with no content. Twenty stores an empty\nJSON array as null, so the recording read as never imported and stayed\nin PROCESSING forever. The import now stores an \\`EMPTY\\` transcript\nmarker and the recording completes.\n\nDeferred: twenty-shared''s transcript marker type and guard still only\nknow \\`PENDING\\` and \\`FAILED\\`; the transcript tab falls through to the\nCOMPLETED copy for an empty marker.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25793?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc