github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/00598ef1ed537b4dec6214f2f68f6f5fdd430b6e","node_id":"C_kwDOTzfBtdoAKDAwNTk4ZWYxZWQ1MzdiNGRlYzYyMTRmMmY2OGY2ZjVmZGQ0MzBiNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02","sha":"96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02"}],"sha":"00598ef1ed537b4dec6214f2f68f6f5fdd430b6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/00598ef1ed537b4dec6214f2f68f6f5fdd430b6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138291814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lakshayyy-m","id":138291814,"login":"Lakshayyy-m","node_id":"U_kgDOCD4qZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lakshayyy-m","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:26:50Z","email":"lakshaymanchanda06@gmail.com","name":"Lakshay Manchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:26:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add create/complete file upload action tools for MCP (#25503)\n\nCloses #25275\n\n## Summary\n- Replaces the one-shot base64 `upload_file` tool with two thin ACTION\ntools that wrap `FileUploadService`: `create_file_upload({ filename,\nsize })` and `complete_file_upload({ fileId })`.\n- The MCP client PUTs bytes to the returned `uploadUrl` (S3 or local).\nFiles land in `agent-chat/` and go through the existing MIME/SVG checks.\nNo MCP-specific file service, folder, or cleanup.\n- Gated by `UPLOAD_FILE` in `ActionToolProvider`, same as email. Hidden\nfrom in-app chat (`AI_CHAT_EXCLUDED_TOOL_NAMES`) and workflow agents\n(`WORKFLOW_AGENT_EXCLUDED_TOOL_NAMES`).\n- MCP instructions describe create → PUT → complete, then use the\n`fileId` in a FILES value or `code_interpreter.files`. Notes that\n`update_many` does not copy FILES and `update_one` replaces the whole\nlist.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Unit tests for both tools (happy path + `FileUploadException`,\nmocks called once with expected args)\n- [x] Live MCP (Admin `jane.austen@apple.dev`): initialize, catalog,\ncreate → PUT → complete, then `create_one_attachment` onto a company\n- [x] Live MCP (Member `jony.ive@apple.dev`, tools allowed): create →\nPUT → complete\n- [x] Live MCP (Guest `phil.schiler@apple.dev`, no tools): tools absent\nfrom initialize/catalog/learn, `execute_tool` returns not found\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Etienne <45695613+etiennejouan@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"97e3dd71675ca15830340ac7dcc4cadeb9b4809e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/97e3dd71675ca15830340ac7dcc4cadeb9b4809e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/96609b97ae4b837cd576a58a57b9f7078e131f02","verification":{"payload":"tree 97e3dd71675ca15830340ac7dcc4cadeb9b4809e\nparent 45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea\nauthor Lakshay Manchanda <lakshaymanchanda06@gmail.com> 1789133210 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789133210 +0000\n\nfeat: add create/complete file upload action tools for MCP (#25503)\n\nCloses #25275\n\n## Summary\n- Replaces the one-shot base64 `upload_file` tool with two thin ACTION\ntools that wrap `FileUploadService`: `create_file_upload({ filename,\nsize })` and `complete_file_upload({ fileId })`.\n- The MCP client PUTs bytes to the returned `uploadUrl` (S3 or local).\nFiles land in `agent-chat/` and go through the existing MIME/SVG checks.\nNo MCP-specific file service, folder, or cleanup.\n- Gated by `UPLOAD_FILE` in `ActionToolProvider`, same as email. Hidden\nfrom in-app chat (`AI_CHAT_EXCLUDED_TOOL_NAMES`) and workflow agents\n(`WORKFLOW_AGENT_EXCLUDED_TOOL_NAMES`).\n- MCP instructions describe create → PUT → complete, then use the\n`fileId` in a FILES value or `code_interpreter.files`. Notes that\n`update_many` does not copy FILES and `update_one` replaces the whole\nlist.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Unit tests for both tools (happy path + `FileUploadException`,\nmocks called once with expected args)\n- [x] Live MCP (Admin `jane.austen@apple.dev`): initialize, catalog,\ncreate → PUT → complete, then `create_one_attachment` onto a company\n- [x] Live MCP (Member `jony.ive@apple.dev`, tools allowed): create →\nPUT → complete\n- [x] Live MCP (Guest `phil.schiler@apple.dev`, no tools): tools absent\nfrom initialize/catalog/learn, `execute_tool` returns not found\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Etienne <45695613+etiennejouan@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpAGqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYHMQACUlB5NW0Wikrpv3MVI7rHRe\nesx6lsEkcHKamXqdm4lfFIblXZMfFGiH5Fy3DFc7UiCroW0tAF9U0ie4LAH9Bnb6\nKBuoSNOP8g62kbeEigAeajbQPJjOEzTv9n5h+asX5r0BjrzxYESj/WcftoSXtVSV\ne4HKvSBgMfQq4TzaNxaQEFft9LmQczQh+RHjajgf/UIIlXR5miGGKFhnZPWJjprL\nyuLWjzJZIzMD5Nk9ONKYM5BpDhQiBLH1C6Rx/BJe3nbXDRqaN7K1/EBLNDD+r8Vh\n11NjFX/GoFpGgTnSPF8f9+MjOLF1g74otmxULtTh4VY52JtDtdyOqpgI5x5fDwlE\npmDn/kMPkejlCL/QAmjtJSbHf3ROFQJ396pqmOcxsHyYmCzQVDaYc39b/AcjTmms\nEyeBR2EijlaBvysi9XVylVzcsxu7SdUqGNVa+Q9sUjqtN8hJTEeTa1cbGV5vGgHd\nwldrCU4DeRiEijY1G+cMB2vOs4IXrvAwHmZHidCan6Lb