b.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:17:45Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:17:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(storybook): prevent oversized Argos screenshots (#25779)\n\nArgos''s Storybook capture enlarged viewport-sized stories after applying\nCSS zoom, and the affected SDK did not reliably restore the iframe\nbetween captures. This produced the 9600×7392 screenshot in build 5574\nand contributed to the visual comparison worker repeatedly running out\nof memory.\n\nPin `@argos-ci/storybook` to 6.2.3 in twenty-front and twenty-ui for the\niframe-restoration fix, set the frontend preview''s fit-to-content zoom\nto 1, and make the frontend browser viewport explicit at 1200×900. Keep\nthe dependency explanation and lockfile aligned with the exact version.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Frontend direct type check and formatting pass.\n- The existing SettingsSubdomain story suite was verified with this SDK\nand capture configuration: all five stories passed, and Reserved\nSubdomain produced a 1200×916 screenshot.\n- Full-file lint still flags the pre-existing mock-image color in\npreview.tsx.\n\nRollout: deploy the companion Argos worker guard first. After merging\nthis capture fix, establish a fresh main-branch baseline and rerun PR\nvisual builds because screenshots now use 1× zoom. Worker memory remains\nunchanged.\n\nCompanion PRs: [Argos worker\nguard](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty-argos/pull/13), [Factory\nupload validation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty-factory/pull/115).","tree":{"sha":"45527dbddce66605cd4080ab3ae97b067fe7591c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/45527dbddce66605cd4080ab3ae97b067fe7591c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 45527dbddce66605cd4080ab3ae97b067fe7591c\nparent ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1789132665 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789132665 +0000\n\nfix(storybook): prevent oversized Argos screenshots (#25779)\n\nArgos''s Storybook capture enlarged viewport-sized stories after applying\nCSS zoom, and the affected SDK did not reliably restore the iframe\nbetween captures. This produced the 9600×7392 screenshot in build 5574\nand contributed to the visual comparison worker repeatedly running out\nof memory.\n\nPin `@argos-ci/storybook` to 6.2.3 in twenty-front and twenty-ui for the\niframe-restoration fix, set the frontend preview''s fit-to-content zoom\nto 1, and make the frontend browser viewport explicit at 1200×900. Keep\nthe dependency explanation and lockfile aligned with the exact version.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Frontend direct type check and formatting pass.\n- The existing SettingsSubdomain story suite was verified with this SDK\nand capture configuration: all five stories passed, and Reserved\nSubdomain produced a 1200×916 screenshot.\n- Full-file lint still flags the pre-existing mock-image color in\npreview.tsx.\n\nRollout: deploy the companion Argos worker guard first. After merging\nthis capture fix, establish a fresh main-branch baseline and rerun PR\nvisual builds because screenshots now use 1× zoom. Worker memory remains\nunchanged.\n\nCompanion PRs: [Argos worker\nguard](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty-argos/pull/13), [Factory\nupload validation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty-factory/pull/115).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/+JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjiwQAEUWPo1OQwO4gLjskUdYoauB\nWeBSFOUSTUUdhgxmUo4uUEJHIhKMtWiJOmys/7mHsIZvP7XlJKrAqkvVHkYSovvU\nFggGkEfQ36GV39J1JicQWF+FjDq0UURzKiAvkdPV9W6OEUxBX4ar/6NA1H6kWgKz\nD9uQMc+i5ZpTEIuFu+RTJ8t7HiV+mrJO3qHnArKCUpoXCq+uUudz/iC+LasBCtVV\nXgQSabOhlDWuUfhmuy5r78IFZfZNP1ELDYd4IBDZLSGCDHwQUZfbNJcYm3K0PCmv\n9b5N7q3QHZGNM51VC1v1PM/VbO8Sn6e2Phfino0FBFhx6Ct+VYwyy2HVUDNZ/Uh0\nHHF3av4PEwz+LYb8ZA2RxkyZn+oWjSxh9wfeWIvNuvWQmamGw82G9lfbb6xs5Wt4\n0IqpEmMGD/7BhHNTduQKjuDfyB85MPh2BJ22tgpLUBqPYMpwDY3VReMmvx/DxHjT\nn8lQoGTN8XVReSjpAb5QWaliqGa6k6IgzgIXbMX+Vpk+rnNJbW3pB38dabxH8Dlp\nMESs9JaATl78d+JTTQddCl2TsZlxOrVQcMaWghxE9t/lQedYxH4r2oijAxIYM6Gw\nb4RXFUkOt/zhVD8jbQK+phe06CBQrinDPvPneb4Ssxyu/SlXA3P61APIX4tlz323\nxVT7Ff1CiSQLrqjzJFM0\n=FZAv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T09:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea","node_id":"C_kwDOTzfBtdoAKDQ1YTJkMWNlOTc5YTExZGRhZjg3Y2I5NWY4M2E5OWY1MTlhNjM3ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-1999/twenty/commit/ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952","sha":"ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952"}],"sha":"45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/45a2d1ce979a11ddaf87cb95f83a99f519a637ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142569587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ehconitin","id":142569587,"login":"ehconitin","node_id":"U_kgDOCH9wcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:15:58Z","email":"142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nitin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:15:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Granola 6/8: Expose Granola notes to workflows and AI (#25575)\n\nExposes Granola notes to workflows and AI.\n\n- `granola-sync-note` and `granola-list-notes` as workflow actions and\nAI tools, `granola-list-folders` as an AI tool, all validated with zod\nand bounded to 30 items per page.\n- Actions return a structured \"not connected\" result when no key is\nsaved instead of throwing.\n- Deployed-function smoke tests for the stack''s routes and actions.\n\nStack 6/8. Review against `ehco/granola-5-history`; merge in order and\nretain base branches until dependent PRs are retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","tree":{"sha":"057bd2d20e97f3d9a4edbfb7dd388f389ef3a748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/057bd2d20e97f3d9a4edbfb7dd388f389ef3a748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/ddc56857e45a82a47157a490a0d342e07550d952","verification":{"payload":"tree 057bd2d20e97f3d9a4edbfb7dd388f389ef3a748\nparent 94bd5864cb085849d7e7f1051534b31d9286da4c\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789132558 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789132558 +0000\n\nGranola 6/8: Expose Granola notes to workflows and AI (#25575)\n\nExposes Granola notes to workflows and AI.\n\n- `granola-sync-note` and `granola-list-notes` as workflow actions and\nAI tools, `granola-list-folders` as an AI tool, all validated with zod\nand bounded to 30 items per page.\n- Actions return a structured \"not connected\" result when no key is\nsaved instead of throwing.\n- Deployed-function smoke tests for the stack''s routes and actions.\n\nStack 6/8. Review against `ehco/granola-5-history`; merge in order and\nretain base branches until dependent PRs are retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/8fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhEEQADwUu4lfEUBZ67pvYa0EXE9V\nIcTeuFJaF2wjtludFaJFme5Wo/S118q4Cq9o/gt5voNq1cW6EXZsWXcHQpjP0MIH\n6L7hJrNp/bHL/i3JvlLDPVt0FiVriXTP9kxPHiE/inxMAZi8fzwvlqx4UxFYE4+X\n6Tg9l8qz5mJNd/8Nf7GqV2QcicNNSH6oyXqDfUTerUPTI2+Z/osQC0juqbQKA7W4\nzf0iVl7mP7g3J8eGZwOxapYnoVItCjR6siQJWx6WzcSB6QNpt2ZEUsR++PiWrvHp\nfbkYCS80aF1PrGQV785m/ZycEbNDUy5hdK