ngs\nnavigation and page eligibility; changed-file lint passes. Full\ntypechecking is blocked by existing shared dependency/type mismatches in\nthe local worktree.\n\n## Screenshot\n\nSettings disabled during layout editing:\n\n<img width=\"330\" alt=\"Navigation modes with Settings disabled during\nlayout editing\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bf1790b-f306-49bf-a38f-4f137fa4e2f1\"\n/>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25760?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"1d43b3975eb1cd93fe51ff07f548dc3fda73980c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/1d43b3975eb1cd93fe51ff07f548dc3fda73980c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/94bd5864cb085849d7e7f1051534b31d9286da4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d43b3975eb1cd93fe51ff07f548dc3fda73980c\nparent b523a208504ba86e7765fcb6c24630014cc68b6c\nauthor Thomas des Francs <tdesfrancs@gmail.com> 1789132157 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789132157 +0000\n\nRestrict AI and Settings access during layout editing (#25760)\n\n## Summary\n\nDisable the AI and Settings buttons while Edit layout is active, with\ntooltips explaining that editing must finish before navigating. Apply\nthis behavior in both the expanded sidebar and collapsed icon rail,\nrestore navigation when editing ends, and block the Settings keyboard\nshortcut. The workspace menu remains accessible.\n\nHide Edit layout from command menus on AI chat and Settings pages, and\nguard command execution on those routes. The dedicated Settings action\nthat opens a record for customization remains available.\n\nValidation: 13 focused tests pass for blocked/restored AI and Settings\nnavigation and page eligibility; changed-file lint passes. Full\ntypechecking is blocked by existing shared dependency/type mismatches in\nthe local worktree.\n\n## Screenshot\n\nSettings disabled during layout editing:\n\n<img width=\"330\" alt=\"Navigation modes with Settings disabled during\nlayout editing\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bf1790b-f306-49bf-a38f-4f137fa4e2f1\"\n/>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25760?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/2NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqBsQABzrtnGmjik7Byg8Ugv5bKIh\ngQHLKUrnLqMY7V55+WvvRRRN/wiSLJli+VS60MaBvlQq9TjoMRgWd6Wih0g81rkt\nlKh4eTz1W/7cz/AKNkzYY14tSALCtpCbfaM1Jn463En3nRT6HeNLbEpuTFfLCUf6\ntCYrU9Ioi9sLY+BpzVLSQGVm8GxoXXdqMKSyyuduzCewGzKZQDcbwgn5tYOZQXBM\ny6OWL9NsIpsSdjznXMQgfoZ9GMFZvhW36in+ee5/qeTEEwjvzwgR7I0fMVkg9Bmo\nN7VyEk62+LxzfztAyiQ2eJHKSDEwctAV6F7JneUAlnWEz4CH0z5NQFT390NEEpw/\nkRkv4GTweUDWKIIo5fP97DMlXwmimejoWJnBeqTM161Gm5dOzak8LlOwNDZH3FmM\nqNhkSTX0KlRNC4DJa9zxCZQ5jXzxWllM57PyaAx4PJeh7yeZyw0eQJUHXr06+Xt+\nXz2f0HWvqMh7o3btnvQyg5eUQDeD6mxA0NMlqui0ad5EhkPyVkoOygs+QWcvFm9p\nnYyvtovkXh0UIFMaN75mZiiMzEWEt/Q+rvvRr5qnqGZuB0hmg8qvyGsXBYn6UUuf\nkoeMh