wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ehconitin","id":142569587,"login":"ehconitin","node_id":"U_kgDOCH9wcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/b523a208504ba86e7765fcb6c24630014cc68b6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:06:26Z","email":"142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nitin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:06:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Granola 5/8: Import Granola history and recover missed updates (#25574)\n\nImports Granola history and recovers missed updates.\n\n- 31-day import when the webhook is first registered, manual imports of\n1 to 3650 days from the settings panel (`POST /granola/backfill`), and a\n04:00 daily catch-up that imports notes updated in the last two days.\n- Discovery and batch jobs use deterministic job ids that include the\nrun window, so retries dedupe without skipping later runs. Paced at one\nnote every four seconds through a shared KV schedule.\n- A stalled cursor stops the run and is logged instead of being retried.\n- The daily catch-up never re-enables a paused endpoint; Resume in the\nsettings does.\n- Pacing reservations from concurrent discovery workers can overlap; app\nKV has no compare-and-set.\n\nStack 5/8. Review against `ehco/granola-4-live-sync`; merge in order and\nretain base branches until dependent PRs are retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","tree":{"sha":"64b5c0b4764166f50b2291b6ef453fc7fe97e563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/64b5c0b4764166f50b2291b6ef453fc7fe97e563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/b523a208504ba86e7765fcb6c24630014cc68b6c","verification":{"payload":"tree 64b5c0b4764166f50b2291b6ef453fc7fe97e563\nparent 7522e1deaab1ef6e39ced1c5a2c0ee2923b15fcc\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789131986 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789131986 +0000\n\nGranola 5/8: Import Granola history and recover missed updates (#25574)\n\nImports Granola history and recovers missed updates.\n\n- 31-day import when the webhook is first registered, manual imports of\n1 to 3650 days from the settings panel (`POST /granola/backfill`), and a\n04:00 daily catch-up that imports notes updated in the last two days.\n- Discovery and batch jobs use deterministic job ids that include the\nrun window, so retries dedupe without skipping later runs. Paced at one\nnote every four seconds through a shared KV schedule.\n- A stalled cursor stops the run and is logged instead of being retried.\n- The daily catch-up never re-enables a paused endpoint; Resume in the\nsettings does.\n- Pacing reservations from concurrent discovery workers can overlap; app\nKV has no compare-and-set.\n\nStack 5/8. Review against `ehco/granola-4-live-sync`; merge in order and\nretain base branches until dependent PRs are retargeted.\n\nReview order:\n\n1. [Add the Granola application\nscaffold](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25570)\n2. [Add Granola API access and credential\nsettings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25571)\n3. [Map Granola notes into Call\nRecordings](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25572)\n4. [Connect Granola webhooks and live\nsynchronization](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25573)\n5. [Import Granola history and recover missed\nupdates](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25574)\n6. [Expose Granola notes to workflows and\nAI](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25575)\n7. [Filter Granola synchronization by\nfolder](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25576)\n8. [Add Granola listing copy and setup\ndocumentation](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25577)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/zkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6b4QAH41m6bREhsPXlvs2WgXIi31\n9LfaiBbH+MfTZ9GxAW1Tcw6RBVRi3JRDD3pDurlfokxGwLZhAdQxe2gE8e/niy0C\nomkH/YwdGwwqRLIEJDRnUETarWA3EUqhB2UlZibBeLMrxzf+OnpsuEG0CIeJSN+D\nOArbTViEuLfqRHAvFu9FvcL4wu8S/H/ScZNW4ExlFVm5iNm6NwEzIyPcNOPQOySz\nYyEgBom3Kh5f3skJI/k1v0Dd0FZirWyXOcpM3p6x8YzY8jVy26wF4f7t8QqKq7lC\nlJl+DVRvu08TgJgwtARtjVTsEUSWD+DN9zxPC13AldA2Ushx7clx29Q/OIVB0POT\nzZqEW+R5jPqcq7tcmn7QZ0/MhjFZ274lx+2o3aqrWZlwbUN3LqZP5z5MW1W27Mk0\n/Cbo+R8KIlwv5Si6hi3Pt868CFzMNi0g0CH3vudzB0dBKrFWWCs1rvcGz5CDM6V/\nAs9pJi5r02K7fLSIjMA/m349Mtb24Avf4ewcFFyleBgE3jfz7z67aAZg5O9fuC9f\n5wbIzMno1L0AM5ltYn97A21FZKGh2iNSDBS5BeXVb/kPWDRDjePy8/QsQDPrU+as\nRauZVIvK3HsJzJYKPfnHuonDu99pVwLjpleqj1/dFsCh8+bOiEbjbUsTQJuIbo4x\nPihZuM5vlYb2usaH32bo\n=58Ax\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T09:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"http