ub.com/users/prastoin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prastoin","id":45004772,"login":"prastoin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA0Nzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/33829b9973ef4f6fce895ea74176fe4c02221be4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T09:40:50Z","email":"45004772+prastoin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paul Rastoin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T09:40:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix CLAUDE.md guard import sources (#25789)\n\nThe house rules pointed to `twenty-shared/utils` for `isNonEmptyString`,\nbut it isn''t exported there. All imports come from `@sniptt/guards` (254\nin twenty-server, 274 in twenty-front, 23 in twenty-shared).\n\nThe bullet now names the source for each set of guards:\n- `twenty-shared/utils`: `isDefined`, `isNonEmptyArray`,\n`isPlainObject`, ...\n- `@sniptt/guards`: `isNonEmptyString`, `isString`, `isNull`,\n`isObject`, ...\n\n`isNonEmptyArray` is exported by both; `twenty-shared/utils` is the\nmajority import (101 vs 45), so it''s listed there.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25789?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"a1cc0a415600289f7f9803deef4f73aa21582023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/a1cc0a415600289f7f9803deef4f73aa21582023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/33829b9973ef4f6fce895ea74176fe4c02221be4","verification":{"payload":"tree a1cc0a415600289f7f9803deef4f73aa21582023\nparent 85d15032344b9da3a3a86e8141375519ee198228\nauthor Paul Rastoin <45004772+prastoin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789119650 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789119650 +0000\n\nFix CLAUDE.md guard import sources (#25789)\n\nThe house rules pointed to `twenty-shared/utils` for `isNonEmptyString`,\nbut it isn''t exported there. All imports come from `@sniptt/guards` (254\nin twenty-server, 274 in twenty-front, 23 in twenty-shared).\n\nThe bullet now names the source for each set of guards:\n- `twenty-shared/utils`: `isDefined`, `isNonEmptyArray`,\n`isPlainObject`, ...\n- `@sniptt/guards`: `isNonEmptyString`, `isString`, `isNull`,\n`isObject`, ...\n\n`isNonEmptyArray` is exported by both; `twenty-shared/utils` is the\nmajority import (101 vs 45), so it''s listed there.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25789?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End o