 What does this PR do?\n\nConfirmationModal stays mounted. Type the confirm string, Cancel, open\nit again: input is empty but Delete can still be enabled.\n\nReset the input + validity on close, and cancel the 250ms debounce so it\ncannot flip the button back on.\n\n### How did you verify your code works?\n\nStory `ResetsInputWhenReopened`.\n\nRepro: Settings → MCP & APIs → API key → Delete → type yes → Cancel →\nDelete again.\n\n### Screenshots\n\nScreen recording from Twenty (API key delete confirm):\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ff870b0-a84e-4b92-900b-a9736af278ff\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25674?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Etienne <45695613+etiennejouan@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo8Y0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfpQQAKvsFrj1ZJwp8Mg+SLZmtGw/\nW7/C9cx2yMXmPDHYrpP/vfS9e9a6IKnO62BvoWQ3h0V/BSpEU6ndXPAVLkMWcINy\nnfT7x75VzSxE576ym5aoNIkjGykSt1I9h+8Sno4QNl846xJbBGRGXcEyopLUQF71\nyoE4D/wfQsuZxeE4v2QbzS70RL0VfWX5gsqks+wK7u8Bs6fPBHTMiKKGspJf8N0E\nwrnPn9jOqDUeX1V+wwKS3j/jeUyQ1+NduXL2+s36FD2f4gyMDLBDagVs6X7H/S0v\nPf+xls3m7MBaWnq6juYSa868GKi4uPH+ZmXB5N8236qmPKHgCN38DI16D/hSkarR\nw8P/NPfbHvvRJe0OCjdlinfoTAR8IazCH4f8svQHIWbF2rHm1uRH8ivouO2x2i0H\nFflj5KtdL9+Pz0oYW4FZQBOshpnCQjwiA9U7hn9g3NnWWBLyTgJ3NdZsEtyb5j6s\n6VmzSn/JTwNxgT7PkwXZ+THAF7ITRS3eZ7rHogxcUqPSGmEhw8gzrO2sAkzpBpIj\nwg+C4fQC1on6L6u4ezrY2EIGvLbVWYLA+Tenl