MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/d2e291d6a48322a29f8259c489ae48b03994c6e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:05:30Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:05:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: sync AI model catalog (#25775)\n\nAutomated daily sync of the AI model catalog.\n\n- Model identity, pricing, context windows and availability come from\n[models.dev](https://models.dev).\n- Intelligence, speed and cost per task come from [Artificial\nAnalysis](https://artificialanalysis.ai/),\n  which requires `ARTIFICIAL_ANALYSIS_API_KEY`.\n\nNew models meeting inclusion criteria (tool calling, pricing data,\ncontext limits) are added\nautomatically. Benchmark data is best-effort: a model Artificial\nAnalysis has not rated keeps\nevery other field and simply carries no `benchmark` entry.\n\n**Please review before merging** and check the coverage summary below\nfor models that silently\nstopped matching.\n\n### Benchmark coverage\n\n- General-purpose models with an intelligence index: **51/80** (64%)\n- Declared effort variants with an index measured at their own effort:\n**69/113** (61%)\n- General-purpose models with a cost per task: **24/80** (30%)\n- Specialized models excluded from the denominator: 10\n\n<details><summ