/__tests__/send-email.workflow-action.spec.ts\n  ● SendEmailWorkflowAction › caller identity propagation › passes the run caller userWorkspaceId to the tool for user-driven runs\n\n    expect(jest.fn()).toHaveBeenCalledWith(...expected)\n\n    Expected: Anything, ObjectContaining {\"userWorkspaceId\": \"20202020-3333-4333-8333-333333333333\", \"workspaceId\": \"workspace-1\"}\n    Received: {\"body\": \"hi\", \"connectedAccountId\": \"account-1\", \"files\": [], \"recipients\": {\"to\": \"test@example.com\"}, \"subject\": \"Test\"}, {\"workspaceId\": \"workspace-1\"}\n\n    Number of calls: 1\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n- the spec is 18/18 green with the fix and 1 red without it (stashed the\nfix sources over the spec and re-ran, identical failure)\n- draft-email spec 7/7 green, whole workflow-executor tree 39 suites /\n437 tests green, whole tool tree 28 suites / 189 tests green\n- tsgo typecheck clean, oxlint + oxfmt clean on the touched files\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25709?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqor64CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnPsQABoU/ao6xwO760Kt1Oblju5M\nQWUvSADuX2wUs9PvaOJ/+pQ8MTnlm1rN6BfKU95p33t2JZTRReIq1zzpRxaLn1lZ\nhYhTwDdiVkgNOca8W+cwZuYYKqGSmtiA0Y4qmlGzhWJVVsQuDZNytKdzVA6CKhVM\nmzGuA26bLamJPvp9WU97VMAvL2v7UjeGkDTc46UqgY0e/OwdPTNydLSPVic5jvDU\nMU/36bS+Zz1r