://api.github.com/users/neo773/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neo773","id":62795688,"login":"neo773","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzk1Njg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/aea02a5aa08099c7681d820a3b99a9aba10573d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:17:18Z","email":"62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com","name":"neo773"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:17:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Import CalDAV events from servers that omit getetag (#25728)\n\nFixes #25648. RFC 4791 5.3.4 requires `DAV:getetag` on every calendar\nobject resource, but SmarterMail (and others) leave it empty on the\ncollection PROPFIND, so the ctag/etag fallback path dropped every event\nand then cached the ctag, wedging the calendar on \"nothing to sync\"\nforever.\n\nResource versions now resolve from `getetag`, then `getlastmodified`,\nthen a sentinel, and a listing whose members are all unreadable raises a\ndriver error instead of being mistaken for an empty collection (which\nwould otherwise cancel every imported event).\n\nCovered by a new integration suite that proxies Radicale into a\nnon-compliant server: blank etags, no `sync-collection` report, and a\ntoggle that hides collection members.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25728?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"e28f58fb8ecd18ef0d22da34b03c0d44ab1704fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/e28f58fb8ecd18ef0d22da34b03c0d44ab1704fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/aea02a5aa08099c7681d820a3b99a9aba10573d1","verification":{"payload":"tree e28f58fb8ecd18ef0d22da34b03c0d44ab1704fc\nparent 25b04b7dafba7fdc7430ba82ff676de0027ba802\nauthor neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com> 1789046238 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789046238 +0000\n\nImport CalDAV events from servers that omit getetag (#25728)\n\nFixes #25648. RFC 4791 5.3.4 requires `DAV:getetag` on every calendar\nobject resource, but SmarterMail (and others) leave it empty on the\ncollection PROPFIND, so the ctag/etag fallback path dropped every event\nand then cached the ctag, wedging the calendar on \"nothing to sync\"\nforever.\n\nResource versions now resolve from `getetag`, then `getlastmodified`,\nthen a sentinel, and a listing whose members are all unreadable raises a\ndriver error instead of being mistaken for an empty collection (which\nwould otherwise cancel every imported event).\n\nCovered by a new integration suite that proxies Radicale into a\nnon-compliant server: blank etags, no `sync-collection` report, and a\ntoggle that hides collection members.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\