://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/bbd9b444df3c5ca026a97caf4061cf04ba72d295"}],"sha":"d12b9e4e91261a57a6675e8181d69f3c4aa22e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/d12b9e4e91261a57a6675e8181d69f3c4aa22e65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/bbd9b444df3c5ca026a97caf4061cf04ba72d295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:55:23Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:55:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Migrate twenty-ui Checkbox to the shared form-control API (#25712)\n\nContinues Phase 2 of the twenty-ui migration by standardizing Checkbox\non Base UI''s controlled/uncontrolled API. Consumers use\n`onCheckedChange(checked, eventDetails)` and string-literal sizes,\nvariants, shapes, and colors. Native props, refs, input refs, and render\ncomposition pass through; the hardcoded form name and test ID are\nremoved.\n\nMigrates frontend consumers, the renderer gallery, and the shared\nmenu/ListItem wrappers. Preserves dimensions, blue selection, orange\nrevoked-permission styling as `color=\"warning\"`, and the spreadsheet\ngrid''s subdued border through `variant=\"soft\"`. Adds `color=\"success\"`,\nkeyboard focus styling, and logical positioning. Checkbox indicators\nfollow Base UI''s computed indeterminate state, including parent\ncheckboxes in groups. Clickable rows update once, Shift-click modifiers\nremain available, and legacy wrapper callbacks retain their boolean-only\nsignatures.\n\nNative form reset is demonstrated with controlled state and an `onReset`\nhandler.\n\nValidation:\n- All 606 UI unit tests pass, including Checkbox conformance.\n- All 42 original targeted UI Chromium stories, the two additional\nsoft-variant catalogs, and two frontend settings stories pass, including\naxe/Argos checks, keyboard interaction, forms, cancellation, mixed\nstate, Shift-click, and single-update row selection.\n- Direct UI, frontend, and renderer typechecks, changed-file\nlint/formatting, the UI build, and bundle/package-size checks pass\nagainst fresh library builds.\n- Light/dark catalogs and control geometry were visually checked.\nExisting color-contrast deferrals remain limited to the catalogs and the\nshared Field-label demonstration.\n\nTargets main independently of #25664 and #25678.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/25712?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of 