ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45004772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prastoin","id":45004772,"login":"prastoin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA0Nzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prastoin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/commits/2721b415671c3310e5989484f77e8c3d6f13da12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:50:55Z","email":"45004772+prastoin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Paul Rastoin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:50:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Register the GraphQL resolver name map cache provider in the worker (#25717)\n\n## Context\n\nThe \"Swallowed invalidations\" panel on the workspace-migration-metrics\ndashboard sits at about 1,100 a day in prod EU, roughly 10% of all\npost-commit cache invalidations. Every one of them is the same error,\nand all of them come from worker pods:\n\n```\n[Runner] Cache invalidation failed after committed transaction: Error: Cache provider with key name \"graphQLResolverNameMap\" not found\n```\n\nThe runner adds `graphQLResolverNameMap` to the keys it recomputes\nwhenever a migration touches object or field metadata. The provider for\nthat key was only registered by `DirectExecutionModule`, which the API\nloads through the GraphQL config module and the worker never loads. So\nany worker-run migration with schema changes hit `getProviderOrThrow`\nand aborted the whole `invalidateAndRecompute`.\n\nIn prod the two sources are `InstallPreInstalledAppsJob` on the default\nworker (about 160 a day) and `StreamAgentChatJob` on the ai-stream\nworker, where agent tools create fields, objects and page layouts (about\n950 a day).\n\n## What this changes\n\n- Move `WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheService` into its own\n`WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheModule`, imported by both\n`DirectExecutionModule` and `CoreEngineModule`, so the worker registers\nthe provider too.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npx tsgo -p tsconfig.json --noEmit` in twenty-server: no errors in\nthe touched files.\n- `npx nx lint:diff-with-main twenty-server`: clean.","tree":{"sha":"2dc7cd36911c0e6f4cc364b282086708c2e5668d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/trees/2dc7cd36911c0e6f4cc364b282086708c2e5668d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-1999/twenty/git/commits/2721b415671c3310e5989484f77e8c3d6f13da12","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dc7cd36911c0e6f4cc364b282086708c2e5668d\nparent ffa690cdd2211aadbb5afbf91b046aa5ab97d46b\nauthor Paul Rastoin <45004772+prastoin@users.noreply.github.com> 1789033855 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789033855 +0000\n\nRegister the GraphQL resolver name map cache provider in the worker (#25717)\n\n## Context\n\nThe \"Swallowed invalidations\" panel on the workspace-migration-metrics\ndashboard sits at about 1,100 a day in prod EU, roughly 10% of all\npost-commit cache invalidations. Every one of them is the same error,\nand all of them come from worker pods:\n\n```\n[Runner] Cache invalidation failed after committed transaction: Error: Cache provider with key name \"graphQLResolverNameMap\" not found\n```\n\nThe runner adds `graphQLResolverNameMap` to the keys it recomputes\nwhenever a migration touches object or field metadata. The provider for\nthat key was only registered by `DirectExecutionModule`, which the API\nloads through the GraphQL config module and the worker never loads. So\nany worker-run migration with schema changes hit `getProviderOrThrow`\nand aborted the whole `invalidateAndRecompute`.\n\nIn prod the two sources are `InstallPreInstalledAppsJob` on the default\nworker (about 160 a day) and `StreamAgentChatJob` on the ai-stream\nworker, where agent tools create fields, objects and page layouts (about\n950 a day).\n\n## What this changes\n\n- Move `WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheService` into its own\n`WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheModule`, imported by both\n`DirectExecutionModule` and `CoreEngineModule`, so the worker registers\nthe provider too.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npx tsgo -p tsconfig.json --noEmit` in twenty-server: no errors in\nthe touched files.\n- `npx nx lint:diff-with-main twenty-server`: clean.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqon2QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATgcQAHmzhK4wh8bz6vLlSaMiYFyi\nCFE7O/EFPzA9zq7EM21f5COKf0VqzDgZYTaAgiAR0KaeXRC7eTy4veuIwUPADYJu\nHbgEnVIIprjkV0dCRibGJRUx+wSEN5mpmWkRpBJSNQ1yzb0613sGC5zDg4YahC9c\nH7VbeR4jUxkCXDK0LHGiBeVGl2FpQ/1XN1iBHFF/NMaXOTUTwG898ulfGtXIQilo\nWsy8ifM+f7SLyEAvwVo/To/ZU19BxEMfrGEo1zC9YH2u84U40mLwi5fiZ2I8HBxG\n7rjHuwSZNv4ZpmLeIGlO4qLGR7oivTvVvu89n6v2lbK/gLR4jP9sR1O65ZTcxnCk\neUGqRDLm6HUpqKW0x0hrBgqH/iOS2hGpPJF9QYQvUMg/9vC5DvjUgRzLM1gUCONY\nCR8pwr/OqJ1Cug7ATNKq8whzek0kfzd10Ce1YuNlWRAsN6iwmOlkFmXh0NOi8gS8\n8A9TAiCrOMYUdwXgLYb8a+JH6iHf/l2hEstdxuOBEnK5ldmDMBtIrIliy/inCgFD\nUyvWLIKRn3G1GE6y6j7qWWRCnNZ1hNa2oLqv+IKAytTGd+fdmkQyeSrDVXqCbGjI\nA8GW2Cb7fv1YMx/7Eh0Y8IMszb3jGblTrXAZEKV4+bJ8rfAKr5kwKqQY2VSW2qna\nUl6/ndQVeQZKy2Xu15GH\n=ZDfe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T09:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/fo