79d22389ee387ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/commits/678d91fbadd51b559b54b493379d22389ee387ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110569339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maksimshirma","id":110569339,"login":"maksimshirma","node_id":"U_kgDOBpcnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/commits/881f9e967b1addd12a550b4287f5e8ccae602533/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T03:04:35Z","email":"maksimshirma@mail.ru","name":"Maksim Shirma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T03:04:35Z","email":"maksimshirma@mail.ru","name":"Maksim Shirma"},"message":"feat: migrate to Yarn Workspaces monorepo\n\nRestructures the single-package app into packages/ + apps/host:\n\n- packages/contract: shared typed contracts (User, AppManifest,\n  HostContext, MicrofrontendProps)\n- packages/sdk: typed Host SDK surface (auth, navigation,\n  notifications, feature flags, permissions)\n- packages/ui: design system (tokens, theme, Button moved here\n  from the host app)\n- packages/lifecycle: microfrontend lifecycle API (bootstrap/mount/\n  unmount/update/prefetch/destroy)\n- packages/event-bus: workspace skeleton only, pub/sub implementation\n  deferred\n- packages/registry: in-memory AppRegistry for app metadata\n- apps/host: the shell app, now importing Button from @hostyara/ui\n  to prove cross-package resolution end-to-end\n\nLibrary packages have no build step (main/types point at src/index.ts\ndirectly) — Yarn''s node-modules linker symlinks @hostyara/* so Vite,\nJest, and tsc resolve and transpile them like any package, since\nthey''re private and consumed only within this monorepo.\n\nRoot keeps all shared tooling (TypeScript, Oxlint, Oxfmt, Jest,\nPlaywright, Storybook, Husky) — yarn typecheck/lint/format/test still\nrun workspace-wide from root, CI and Husky hooks needed no changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NHhtNKFXc64sX7JPHBtJjW","tree":{"sha":"5328efebf0984f8e082daa87460566f1b3db1702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/git/trees/5328efebf0984f8e082daa87460566f1b3db1702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/git/commits/881f9e967b1addd12a550b4287f5e8ccae602533","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110569339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maksimshirma","id":110569339,"login":"maksimshirma","node_id":"U_kgDOBpcnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git