:"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maksimshirma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/commits/c0fd9c610586938e85588afcbb13af8656fcb8ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T20:29:55Z","email":"maksimshirma@mail.ru","name":"Maksim Shirma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T20:29:55Z","email":"maksimshirma@mail.ru","name":"Maksim Shirma"},"message":"Implement React + TypeScript frontend scaffold\n\n- Initialize Yarn 4 with Corepack pinning (yarn@4.12.0)\n- Configure React 19 + TypeScript 5.9 with strict mode\n- Set up Vite dev server (port 3000) with Hot Module Replacement\n- Add Jest unit testing with React Testing Library\n- Configure Playwright for E2E tests (Chromium browser)\n- Set up Storybook with React + Vite framework\n- Configure Oxlint (React, TypeScript, Jest plugins)\n- Configure Oxfmt with defaults\n- Set up Husky Git hooks:\n  - pre-commit: lint and format check\n  - pre-push: typecheck and test suite\n- Create example Button component with stories, tests, styling\n- Add example unit test and E2E test\n- Create comprehensive README with setup, commands, troubleshooting\n- Configure tsconfig with path aliases (@/), DOM types\n- Add all npm scripts for development, building, testing, linting\n\nVerification: all tools pass (typecheck, lint, format, test, e2e, storybook, build)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code","tree":{"sha":"00b43aad09d5fac473578ea77c8f3da16848f088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/git/trees/00b43aad09d5fac473578ea77c8f3da16848f088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maksimshirma/hostyara/git/commits/c0fd9c610586938e85588afcbb13af8656fcb8ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git