or":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:47:06Z","email":"admin@likekiri.com","name":"likekiri-admin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:47:06Z","email":"admin@likekiri.com","name":"likekiri-admin"},"message":"Clientes: sincronización con Firebase (auto-alta JIT + upsert por API key)\n\n- cuentas.firebaseUid y productos.autoAltaFree (aditivos).\n- /api/entitlement acepta email y/o uid (+nombre) y, con autoAltaFree ON, hace\n  auto-alta del usuario como Free (JIT). Respuesta unificada (respuestaEntitlement).\n- Nuevo POST /api/clients (misma apikey+origen): upsert idempotente por\n  (producto,uid) o (producto,email); lo usan el push on-signup y el backfill.\n  No pisa el plan existente.\n- Admin: toggle ''Auto-alta como Free al consultar'' en Ajustes del producto; el\n  ejemplo de consulta muestra email+uid.\n- Guía Firebase (Cloud Function + backfill) en INTEGRACION-APPS.md.","tree":{"sha":"bcf9442c9cc2ae21c9895c01bbeb9f2a49d6cb81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/git/trees/bcf9442c9cc2ae21c9895c01bbeb9f2a49d6cb81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/git/commits/c23d773a2cf5b2080254f3d370190229034b1b74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commit/c23d773a2cf5b2080254f3d370190229034b1b74","node_id":"C_kwDOTzsfWtoAKGMyM2Q3NzNhMmNmNWIyMDgwMjU0ZjNkMzcwMTkwMjI5MDM0YjFiNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commit/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20","sha":"ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commits/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20"}],"sha":"c23d773a2cf5b2080254f3d370190229034b1b74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commits/c23d773a2cf5b2080254f3d370190229034b1b74"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commits/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T00:33:12Z","email":"admin@likekiri.com","name":"likekiri-admin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T00:33:12Z","email":"admin@likekiri.com","name":"likekiri-admin"},"message":"Clientes: gestión por producto, generador de planes y consulta de vigencia\n\n- Subcategorías por producto (askmypast/wordpress/chatmanager): alta/baja manual de clientes con plan, ciclo de facturación (mensual…lifetime) y vigencia calculada.\n- Clave de integración por producto (visible/rotable) + orígenes permitidos; endpoint /api/entitlement (apikey + origen) con planEfectivo/premium/onpremise/features; sin plan o vencido → free.\n- Generador de planes: catálogo global (precio, features, ciclos permitidos, activo/oculto) asociable a productos.\n- UI: menú vertical de productos + tabs Clientes/Ajustes. Guía de integración en INTEGRACION-APPS.md.","tree":{"sha":"0130fa60dbc7ea73feb5779b569bcac97c1beac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/git/trees/0130fa60dbc7ea73feb5779b569bcac97c1beac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/git/commits/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commit/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20","node_id":"C_kwDOTzsfWtoAKGFiNWI1ZWViNDRhODQ5NjUzYTIyNGM1YzcyYjU4ZjA5NWFmMGRmMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commit/a356ba43ec57763a68533dd226ff40fcc2c7efbb","sha":"a356ba43ec57763a68533dd226ff40fcc2c7efbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commits/a356ba43ec57763a68533dd226ff40fcc2c7efbb"}],"sha":"ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095af0df20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pmiguras/likekiri-website/commits/ab5b5eeb44a849653a224c5c72b58f095