ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zintaen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zintaen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zintaen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zintaen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christymelan09-blip/cyberos/commits/13350d1ac2ec81ada23121a88b775addb0dacdfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T19:26:51Z","email":"zintaen@gmail.com","name":"Stephen Cheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T19:26:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"batch/12b: supply-chain — npm audit, gitleaks, SBOM, Dependabot (#152)\n\n* feat(install): supply-chain gates for npm, secrets, SBOM, Dependabot\n\nShip IMP-001/003/043/044: npm audit+license over mcp/docs-tools,\ngitleaks CI+pre-push, payload SBOM emit, Dependabot for npm/actions/cargo.\n\n* batch/12b: fix CI — OSS gitleaks binary + SHA checkout shape.\n\ngitleaks-action requires an org license; run check-secrets.sh with a\nreleased gitleaks binary instead. Update suite-gate shape check for\nSHA-pinned actions/checkout.\n\n* batch/12b: address CodeRabbit review on supply-chain gates.\n\nEnable gitleaks defaults, verify downloads, harden probes/temps, pin\ncredential persistence, and strengthen Dependabot/SBOM acceptance tests.\n\n* batch/12b: allowlist task-doc examples and planted secret probes.\n\nuseDefault=true surfaces historical example tokens in docs/tasks and the\nIMP-003 probe fixtures; path-scope them so CI hard-fails on real leaks.","tree":{"sha":"83aaaca02383136c7700767fc9eed68c868baac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christymelan09-blip/cyberos/git/trees/83aaaca02383136c7700767fc9eed68c868baac5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christymelan09-blip/cyberos/git/commits/13350d1ac2ec81ada23121a88b775addb0dacdfd","verification":{"payload":"tree 83aaaca02383136c7700767fc9eed68c868baac