s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KMK0815/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KMK0815","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/protronic/pdf-annotator/commits/441ce4232fa4da179addaad184c2b7751ecf22dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:43:22Z","email":"m.koeppchen@protronic-gmbh.de","name":"Mathias Köppchen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:43:22Z","email":"m.koeppchen@protronic-gmbh.de","name":"Mathias Köppchen"},"message":"pdf.js 6.4, OpenCloud user as comment author, rounded OpenCloud design\n\n- pdfjs-dist 6.2.108 -> 6.4.299; getPageMappingForSaving() now returns\n  {pageInfos, copyLevels} (saving after page edits was broken otherwise)\n- comment author: read the OpenCloud user store on every access instead\n  of copying it when the extension registers - the user is often not\n  loaded then, comments showed \"Unbekannt\"\n- comment popup shows author and date (stored comments: /T, new ones:\n  the signed-in user); the comment dialog names the user it saves as\n- design: rounded, Nova-like chrome (pdf.js ships it only in the Firefox\n  build) with colors, font and light/dark from the OpenCloud theme\n  (--oc-role-*); the Firefox design tokens pdf.js >= 6.3 reads in its\n  edit toolbars and menus point to the same values; own fallback palette\n  outside OpenCloud\n- harness: the user is loaded after the app starts, like in OpenCloud;\n  asserts the dialog author\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a42287c2bfc2e865cc2d72b7ee0feb844f596b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/protronic/pdf-annotator/git/trees/9a42287c2bfc2e865cc2d72b7ee0feb844f596b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/protronic/pdf-annotator/git/commits/441ce4232fa4da179addaad184c2b7751ecf22dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c