wiki mirror\n\nResearch pass over the Bahmni GitHub org (160 repos) and Confluence wiki\n(1,148 pages), plus source reading of bahmni-core, OpenElis, and the ERP/PACS\natomfeed clients.\n\n- docs/01-14: runtime architecture, OpenMRS modules, frontends, atom-feed\n  integration, domain model, bahmni-core internals, three flows traced\n  end-to-end through source (lab order, drug order, radiology), ecosystem\n  integrations, deployment, and performance/version history\n- wiki/: full local mirror of Confluence space BAH (1,148 pages) as plain\n  text, indexed\n- CLAUDE.md: orientation for future sessions working in this directory\n\nGenerated with Claude Code\nvia Happy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Happy <yesreply@happy.engineering>","tree":{"sha":"cde989b4ebde27211170ace56f0a6250ae7eb518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A1i-Tabatabaei/bahmni-architecture-notes/git/trees/cde989b4ebde27211170ace56f0a6250ae7eb518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/A1i-Tabatabaei/bahmni-architecture-notes/git/commits/e66aeca9b4a331868adb91e1dc0bcb22a6a13a95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co