s://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AngadBasandrai/qirc/commits/39d4d88a6ccae13baa7713cbc244699ccb411326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:23:17Z","email":"angadbasandrai@gmail.com","name":"Angad Basandrai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:35:34Z","email":"angadbasandrai@gmail.com","name":"Angad Basandrai"},"message":"Add a showcase to the playground and the terminal\n\nThe playground''s Showcase button, or #showcase in the address, steps\nthrough eight demos for a talk, each a few runs of the playground with the\nprogram in the editor, the options in the controls and a clock against a\n3:20 target. The demos'' programs join the Example menu, and the worker\ndefines the calibration files they need. scripts/showcase.ps1 shows the\nsame demos in a terminal, reading the same programs from the page.\n\nThe WebAssembly module gains define, for named calibration files, and runs\nsurface and explain. Progress no longer reads the clock when it cannot show\nanything, which panicked in WebAssembly.","tree":{"sha":"866f5d0388ce0d232e76a10c6f387f68f5301a03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AngadBasandrai/qirc/git/trees/866f5d0388ce0d232e76a10c6f387f68f5301a03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AngadBasandrai/qirc/git/commits/39d4d88a6ccae13baa7713cbc244699ccb411326","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112087272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AngadBasandrai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":